/* The application manifest of xc3.exe (xc3.manifest) and its icon (xc3.ico, the repository's gold 3, also the icon
   of XC3-Setup.exe and of the installer window). tools/build_game.py compiles it with the runtime objects. It is not
   in libxc3rt.a: build_game.py --icon can name another icon. */
1 24 "xc3.manifest"
1 ICON "xc3.ico"
